@apiUrl = http://localhost:7110/api/v2
@email = admin@exceptionless.test
@password = tester

# External sign-in returns 401 when the account is unavailable. Existing provider links identify their exact provider and subject.
# Concurrent account changes may return 409; retrieve the current state before retrying.

### login to test account
# @name login
POST {{apiUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "{{email}}",
    "password": "{{password}}"
}

###

@token = {{login.response.body.$.token}}

### Password authentication shares the login attempt window
# Requests wait up to ten seconds when password checks are underway; completed failures retain their limit.
# Password changes replace the current user session; use the returned token afterward.
# Password sign-in checks the current stored credentials, account status, and email.
GET {{apiUrl}}/users/me
Authorization: Basic {{email}}:{{password}}

### Authentication token through the client alias
GET {{apiUrl}}/users/me
Authorization: Basic client:{{token}}

### Get Current User
# @name currentUser
GET {{apiUrl}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
@userId = {{currentUser.response.body.$.id}}
@avatarFile = ./avatar.png

### Upload Avatar
# Replace {{avatarFile}} with a local PNG, JPEG, GIF, or WebP image.
POST {{apiUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/avatar
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=avatar-boundary

--avatar-boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="avatar.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< {{avatarFile}}
--avatar-boundary--

### Remove Avatar
DELETE {{apiUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/avatar
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
